  <div class="centered-container w-container">
    <div class="section-body iteration-section">
      <div class="text-wrapper">
        <h2 class="highlight_body subtitle-uppercase subtitle-uppercase-mobile">Results
        </h2>
        <p class="section-title section-title-mobile">Overall results of multiple tests
        </p>
        <p class="subpage-paragraph-left">The combination of the one-time payment link on all 3 platforms, implementing fewer selectable amounts, and price anchoring, in December led to a 
          <strong>119% revenue uplift
          </strong> compared to December 2024.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="iteration-results-block">
        <p class="iteration-section__subtitle">Total revenue for supporter in 2025</p>
        <ul class="iteration-learnings__list iteration-results__list">
          <li>Year to Year total revenue: <strong>+15%</strong></li>
          <li>Year to Year new supporters: <strong>+16%</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <aside class="advocacy-callout" aria-label="My role and impact">
        <p class="advocacy-callout__lead">My role/impact in this project was: driving the research and redesign of the whole donation experience, pre-validating my hypothesis with user interviews &amp; surveys, preparing for A/B tests, and advocating for the one-time payment implementation.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
